      "statement": ".github/workflows/eval.yml (Filtering eval) triggers on pull_request and push to main when paths include agent.py, mcp_server.py, evals/**, or eval.yml; it installs Harbor, runs the filter-exclusion-senior task, then converts the job to a verdict with check_reward.py and uploads run evidence as an artifact.",
